      "created_at": "2017-10-11T01:52:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Well, it's not as simple as beating Ambuscade in Wagner Mars Base with Tachyon on the team and having Chrono-Ranger deal the finishing blow with Temporal Grenade.&nbsp; I had Kill on Sight on Ambuscade, too (it's the bounty with Ambuscade's picture and flavor text, though it has no effect when played on him).&nbsp; Since that's BoT's origin story, I thought that might be it, but no dice.</p><p>Hm... I suppose I could have been more literal and had Tachyon destroy more/all of Ambuscade's stuff first.</p>",
